 "sentences": [
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or ideas along the way.",
  "This way, we ensure that the code behaves predictably across different machines and that everyone is working with the same set of tools.",
  "We use PEP 8 as our style guide, so make sure your code adheres to those conventions.",
  "It helps keep our codebase clean and readable.",
  "Not for now.",
  "Just remember, if you have any questions or need any help, don't hesitate to reach out to me or anyone else on the team.",
  "When employees feel valued and appreciated, it enhances their sense of belonging and motivation to contribute to the company's success.",
  "That's why a tailored approach is best.",
  "They should also be tied to specific achievements or contributions that embody those values.",
  "It's all about creating a culture of appreciation and excellence.",
  "And by doing so, we create a culture of continuous appreciation and motivation.",
  "Now, as we implement this program, it's also crucial to ensure that the process is fair and transparent.",
  "Everyone should have an equal opportunity to be recognized and rewarded.",
  "We'll continue to gather feedback, evaluate the program's effectiveness, and make adjustments as needed to ensure it remains relevant and impactful.",
  "Especially now that you're getting more comfortable with your tasks, it's easy to get absorbed in your work and forget to step away.",
  "So, make sure you take a break every 80 minutes or so.",
  "It'll help you stay focused and refreshed."
 ],
